{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor completed all seven minimum responsibility‑chain items without any serious error, but RC7 (teach‑back/execution confirmation) was only partially satisfied because the final exchange asked the family to confirm a plan that had already been enacted at the hospital without verifying the family’s ability to execute the new home monitoring. No high‑order point was fully triggered and completed with meaningful trajectory impact beyond minimum duties, so the ceiling is Grade 3 (Acceptable).",
